# Scan scope for the invariant gate (`just check-semgrep`, rules in
# checks/semgrep/). This file lives at the repository root because the scanner
# reads it only from the working directory - it cannot be moved next to the
# rules it belongs to.
#
# Presence of this file replaces the scanner's bundled default ignore list, so
# everything that must stay out of scope is named here and nowhere else. The
# bundled default excludes test files; this project does not, because a message
# asserted in a test is the message a user sees.

# Build output and caches. Regenerated, never reviewed.
/target/
__pycache__/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.just-mcp-work/

# Third-party trees.
node_modules/
vendor/
.venv/

# Generated API references, produced by the documentation pipeline.
/docs/c-api/
/docs/cpp-api/
/docs/js-api/

# Generated C artifacts: the header and its Go copy are written by
# scripts/generate_api_c.py from the Rust sources, which are in scope.
/bindings/c/openpit.h
/bindings/go/internal/native/openpit.h

# Lock files and dependency manifests: machine-written, byte-for-byte.
Cargo.lock
go.work.sum
/bindings/go/go.sum
/bindings/js/package-lock.json

# Editor and agent state, untracked.
.git/
.serena/
